ne expression in HSC-4 cells, upon treatment with neem leaf extract in a time-dependent manner, followed by a time-dependent rescue. Our results indicate that neem extract simultaneously affects various important molecular signaling pathways in head and neck cancer cells, some (TGF-β/HSF-1) of which may be therapeutic targets for this devastating tumor.","gpl":"10558","gse":"125021","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by array","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2019/01/15","suppfile":"TXT","samples":[{"accession":"GSM3561345","title":"leaf_rescue_10min"},{"accession":"GSM3561342","title":"dmso_treatment_control_10hr"},{"accession":"GSM3561354","title":"dmso_treatment_control_24hr"},{"accession":"GSM3561348","title":"leaf_rescue_1hr"},{"accession":"GSM3561351","title":"leaf_rescue_10hr"},{"accession":"GSM3561334","title":"leaf_treatment_15min"},{"accession":"GSM3561347","title":"leaf_rescue_30min"},{"accession":"GSM3561350","title":"leaf_rescue_6hr"},{"accession":"GSM3561336","title":"leaf_treatment_1hr"},{"accession":"GSM3561339","title":"leaf_treatment_10hr"},{"accession":"GSM3561353","title":"dmso_rescue_control_24hr"},{"accession":"GSM3561333","title":"leaf_treatment_10min"},{"accession":"GSM3561355","title":"cells_only_control, 2"},{"accession":"GSM3561332","title":"leaf_treatment_5min"},{"accession":"GSM3561352","title":"leaf_rescue_24hr"},{"accession":"GSM3561344","title":"leaf_rescue_5min"},{"accession":"GSM3561337","title":"leaf_treatment_3hr"},{"accession":"GSM3561335","title":"leaf_treatment_30min"},{"accession":"GSM3561340","title":"leaf_treatment_24hr"},{"accession":"GSM3561346","title":"leaf_rescue_15min"},{"accession":"GSM3561338","title":"leaf_treatment_6hr"},{"accession":"GSM3561341","title":"dmso_treatment_control_3hr"},{"accession":"GSM3561349","title":"leaf_rescue_3hr"},{"accession":"GSM3561343","title":"cells_only_control, 1"}],"relations":[],"extrelations":[],"n_samples":24,"seri